        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-S8, Shaker Rose Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Shaker Trim Towel Bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 30 inches. It has a rustic look that is very now within shabby chic decor. This towel bar is available in with medium bronze or oil rubbed bronze finishes. It comes packaged with all the installation hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/shaker-towel-ring-fusion-tr-s8\"><b>Fusion TR-S8 Shaker Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/shaker-trim-robe-hook-fusion-rh-s8\"><b>Fusion RH-S8 Shaker Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/shaker-rose-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-s8\"><b>Fusion PH-S8 Shaker Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-S8</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-S8</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-S8</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
